  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch#PL80.CH.1",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.CH.1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "I. Decretum est, ut quia in vigiltias constitutas noc- turnos fures non caperent, eo quod per diversas in- tercedente conludio, scelera praetermissa custodias exercerent, centenas fieri. In qua centena aliquid deperierit, capitale qui perdiderat recipiat, et latro insequatur. Vel si in alterius centena appareat, et adhuc admoniti si neglexerint, quinos sol condem- nentur. Capitale tamen qui perdiderit, a centena il- la accipiat absque dubio, hoc est, de secunda vel tertia custodia.",
    "chunk_index": 1,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 606,
    "date_range": [
      584,
      629
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch#PL80.CH.2",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.CH.2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "II. Si vestigius comprobatur latronis, tamen prae- s ntia nihil longe multando. Aut si persequens la- tronem suum comprehenderit, integram sibi com- positionem accipiat.",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 606,
    "date_range": [
      584,
      629
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch#PL80.CH.3",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.CH.3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "III. Quod si in truste invenitur, medietatem com- positionis inistis adquirat, et capitale exigat a latrone.",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 606,
    "date_range": [
      584,
      629
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch#PL80.CH.4",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.CH.4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "IV. Si quis in domo alterius, ubi clavis est, fur- tum invenerit, dominus domus de vita componat.",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 606,
    "date_range": [
      584,
      629
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch#PL80.CH.5",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.CH.5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "V. Si quis cum furto capitur, antedictae subjaceat legi.",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 606,
    "date_range": [
      584,
      629
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch#PL80.CH.6",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.CH.6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "VI. Si de suspicione inculpatur, ad fortem veniat.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 606,
    "date_range": [
      584,
      629
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch#PL80.CH.7",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.CH.7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "VII. Si mala forte priserit, Latro tamen, ad utram que partem sint ternas personas electas, ne conlu- dius fieri possit.",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 606,
    "date_range": [
      584,
      629
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch#PL80.CH.8",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.CH.8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "VIII. De servis Ecclesiae aut fisci, vel cujuslibet, quicunque inculpatur, ad fortem veniat, aut ad ple- bium promoveatur, aut ipse precius a domino reformetur. Nam probari periculo subjacebunt.",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 606,
    "date_range": [
      584,
      629
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch#PL80.CH.9",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.CH.9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "IX. Si quis cujuslibet de potentioribus servis qui per diversa possident, de crimine habetur suspectus, domino secretius cum testibus condicatur, ut intra viginti noctes ipsum ante judicem debeat praensenta- re. Quod si in statutum tempus interludente conlu- dio non fecerit, dominus status sui juxta modum culpae inter fredum et faidum compensabitur.",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 606,
    "date_range": [
      584,
      629
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch#PL80.CH.10",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.CH.10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "X. Si servus ante admonitum dominum defuerit, capitale dominus restituat, et de servo faciat cessio- nem; et quum inventus fuerit, detur in vindiciam.",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 606,
    "date_range": [
      584,
      629
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch#PL80.CH.11",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.CH.11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "XI. Si quis occulte de re sibi furata a quolibet la- trone compositionem acceperit, utraque latronis culpa subjaceat. Fur tamen judici praesentetur.",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 606,
    "date_range": [
      584,
      629
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch#PL80.CH.12",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.CH.12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "XII. Ut continuo capitale ei qui perdiderit refor- mare festinet, et latronem perquirat. Quem si in truste perinvenerit, medietatem sibi vindicet vel de- laturam. Si fuerit de facultate latronis, et qui dam- num pertulit, saliatur. Nam si persequens latronem ceperit, integram sibi compositionem simul et solu- tionem, vel quidquid dispendii fuerit, revocavit; fre- pus tamen judici, iu cujus pago est, reservetur.",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 606,
    "date_range": [
      584,
      629
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch#PL80.CH.13",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.CH.13",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "XIII. Nullus latronem vel quemlibet culpabilem, sient summis episcopis convenit, de atrio ecclesiae trahere praesumat. Quod si sunt ccclesiae quibus atria clausa non sint, ab utraque parte parietum terrae spatium, arpennis pro atrio observetur.",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 606,
    "date_range": [
      584,
      629
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch#PL80.CH.14",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.CH.14",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "XIV. Nullus confugiens foris ante dicta loca pro operarum cupiditate se dicat exiie. Quod si fecerint, et capti fuerint, ad dignum sibi supplicium condem- nentur.",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 606,
    "date_range": [
      584,
      629
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch#PL80.CH.15",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.CH.15",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "XV. Quod si cujuslibet servus deserens suum do- minum ad ecclesias confugerit, et ibi primitus domi- nus ejus advenerit, contentio excusatur; reddatur furtum, ut se de pretio redimat.",
    "chunk_index": 15,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 606,
    "date_range": [
      584,
      629
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch#PL80.CH.16",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.CH.16",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "XVI. Si quis ad vestigium minandum vel latronem persequendum admonitus venire noluerit, quinque solidis condemnetur.",
    "chunk_index": 16,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 606,
    "date_range": [
      584,
      629
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch#PL80.CH.17",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.CH.17",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "XVII. Ea quae in Dei nomine pacis tenore consti- tuimus, in perpetuum volumus custodire.",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 606,
    "date_range": [
      584,
      629
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch#PL80.CH.18",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/chlotharius-ii/pl80_64_ch",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.CH.18",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "XVIII. Hoc statuentes, ut si quis ex judicibus hoc decretum violare praesumpserit, vitae periculum sub- jacere cognoscat.",
    "chunk_index": 18,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
